import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.HolomorphicAutomorphismNormalFamilyAnalyticLimit

/-!
# Analytic regularity of normal-family limits in the native threefold model

Complex differentiability on open subsets of `ℂ × ComplexPlane₂` implies
the genuine `ω` regularity used by the native tangent bundle.  The proof
uses three actual Cauchy integrals and the Banach algebra of continuous
functions on their boundary torus.  Together with the locally uniform
limit theorem, this applies to limits of native holomorphic coordinate
maps without any additional power-series or smoothness hypothesis.
-/
